Q: ESLint in VSCode not fixing on save A: <p>Editing vscode <code>settings.json</code> helped resolved issue for me:</p>
<p>From:</p>
<pre><code>  &quot;editor.codeActionsOnSave&quot;: {
    &quot;source.fixAll.eslint&quot;: &quot;explicit&quot;,
  },
</code></pre>
<p>To:</p>
<pre><code>  &quot;editor.codeActionsOnSave&quot;: {
    &quot;source.fixAll.eslint&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,
  },
</code></pre>
